  "body": "### Summary\n\nMigration lot LOT-043 (Phase 3 — engine / Flows (`HFRClient`) — fetch → parse → submit → classify ([ADR 0008](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/adr/0008-hfrclient-orchestration-module.md))): Login (validate before replacing cookies).\n\n### Scope\n\nLogin (validate before replacing cookies)\n\n- Module: HFRClient · Difficulty: medium · Priority: high\n- Audit source: NET-04\n\n### Depends on\n\nLOT-042 (#68), LOT-025 (#53)\n\n### Model\n\nOpus → Fable\n\n### Spec\n\n- [docs/lots/LOT-043-login.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/lots/LOT-043-login.md)\n\n### PRs\n\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#21](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/21) — LOT-043: login that validates before replacing cookies (merged; work)\n- [ezzz/HFRnow#17](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/pull/17) — chore(lots): claim wave 1 and record the wave plan (merged; claim/bookkeeping)\n\n### Old issue (frozen)\n\n[francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#72](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/issues/72) — read-only history.\n\n### Owner / session\n\nHistorical owner: mac/w1-043-opus (2026-10-27)\n\n### Pending captures\n\n- CAP-login-refused-for-flood-or-lockout (#139)\n- CAP-login-with-the-pseudo-typed-in (#140)\n- CAP-editprofil-php-config-hfr-inc-page (#141)\n\n(Rows of the Mac capture backlog that name this lot.)\n\n### Status note\n\n`docs/LOTS.md` status cell on 2026-10-27: `done (#21)`.\n",
